        "sendTo": "={{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.email }}",
        "subject": "Booking Confirmation & Travel Itinerary",
        "message": "=<h2>Booking Confirmation</h2>  <p>Hi <strong>{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.name }}</strong>,</p>  <p>Thank you for using our Smart Tourism Travel Platform.</p>  <p>Your booking request has been successfully processed. Please find your travel details below:</p>  <h3>Travel Details</h3>  <p> <strong>Destination:</strong> {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.destination }}<br> <strong>Travelers:</strong> {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.travelers }}<br> <strong>Travel Dates:</strong> {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.start_date }} to {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.end_date }} </p>  <h3>Booking Details</h3>  <p> <strong>Hotel:</strong> {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.hotel }}<br> <strong>Room Type:</strong> {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.room_type }}<br> <strong>Transport:</strong> {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.transport }} </p>  <h3>Cost Summary</h3>  <p> <strong>Estimated Cost:</strong> ₹39,000<br> <strong>Budget Status:</strong> Within Budget </p>  <h3>Itinerary</h3>  <p>Your personalized itinerary has been generated successfully and is available in your booking record.</p>  <p>We hope you have a wonderful trip and an enjoyable travel experience.</p>  <p> <strong>Regards,</strong><br> Smart Tourism Travel Team </p>",
